{"id": "68996", "title": "市长的初恋爱人", "author": "疏影清", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 28, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68996.htm", "intro": "“轰——” \r\n  刺耳的刹车声划破白茫的雪幕，轻盈的身躯被撞得飞出老远，接着，殷红的血液流出，将洁白的雪花染成了鲜红色。 \r\n  舒影挣扎在车轮下，目光涣散，看着几米开外的亲亲男友扶着别的女子，眸中的爱恋随着血液一起流失。 \r\n  五年的感情，终究抵不过异国他乡的诱惑。 \r\n  再次醒来，陪在身边的是另一个男人，他温柔似水，对她呵护备至，请求她做他的女人。 \r\n  她睁着空洞的大眼，了无生气，“我不想再做任何人的女人。”", "base": "files/article/html/68/68996", "chapters": [{"title": "1-10", "file": "10553921.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "10553922.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "10553923.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-43", "file": "10553924.html", "available": false}, {"title": "44-58", "file": "10553925.html", "available": false}, {"title": "59-70", "file": "10553926.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-82", "file": "10553927.html", "available": false}, {"title": "83-89", "file": "10553928.html", "available": false}, {"title": "90-96", "file": "10553929.html", "available": false}, {"title": "97-103", "file": "10553930.html", "available": false}, {"title": "104-108", "file": "10553931.html", "available": false}, {"title": "109-115", "file": "10553932.html", "available": false}, {"title": "116-121", "file": "10553933.html", "available": false}, {"title": "122-129", "file": "10553934.html", "available": false}, {"title": "130-135", "file": "10553935.html", "available": false}, {"title": "136-142", "file": "10553936.html", "available": false}, {"title": "143-150", "file": "10553937.html", "available": false}, {"title": "151-160", "file": "10553938.html", "available": false}, {"title": "161-167", "file": "10553939.html", "available": false}, {"title": "168-175", "file": "10553940.html", "available": false}, {"title": "176-180", "file": "10553941.html", "available": false}, {"title": "181-186", "file": "10553942.html", "available": false}, {"title": "187-192", "file": "10553943.html", "available": false}, {"title": "193